%[text] # Intro to Image Segmentation
%[text] [⇦ Main Menu](file:../MainMenu.m)
%[text] This script introduces image segmentation in computer vision, which divides images into meaningful regions using edges, textures, and motion cues like optical flow.
%[text] ![Image of 6 gears overlaid by k-means clustering segmentation. There are two orange gears, two blue gears, and two purple gears.](text:image:82c2)
%[text:tableOfContents]{"heading":"**Table of Contents**"}
%[text] %[text:anchor:H_51183E7B] **Before you get started:**
