%[text] ## Local Helper Functions
%[text] If you wish to see the details of the code, select the **View** tab and switch to **Output Inline**. Alternately, select **Output inline** using the icon ![Live script output inline icon](text:image:69cd) at the top right of the Live Editor pane.

